{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17618","headline":"九月十日郡楼独酌 · 羊士谔","name":"九月十日郡楼独酌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"掾史当授衣，郡中稀物役。\n嘉辰怅已失，残菊谁爲惜。\n棂轩一尊泛，天景洞虚碧。\n暮节独赏心，寒江鸣湍石。\n归期北州里，旧友东山客。\n飘荡云海深，相思桂花白。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17618.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17618","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}